{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is nearby, take it. If it's heavy, move it. If visible, approach and scan. Scan area.     list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDesignatedArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
